## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = எச்சரிக்கை: பதிலளிக்காத ஸ்கிரிப்ட்
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = A script on this page may be busy, or it may have stopped responding.  You can stop the script now, or you can continue to see if the script will complete.
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = ஸ்கிரிப்ட்: { $location }
# The & character marks the access key of the checkbox label.
dom-slow-script-dialog-dont-ask-again = மீண்டும் என்னிடம் கேட்காதே (&D)
dom-slow-script-dialog-stop-button = ஸ்கிரிப்ட் நிறுத்து
dom-slow-script-dialog-continue-button = தொடரவும்
